WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Andretti]
I know how deadlines work.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.633
I'm trying to explain that.

3
00:00:03.633 --> 00:00:05.633
Other requests keep coming in,

4
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.000
and I don't always know

5
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.600
which one takes priority.
